        "O(p^2*|V(G)|); across eight shipping p=1009 instances it used "
        "45,831,132 exact modular image operations in 13.985 seconds "
        "(5,728,891 operations and 1.748 seconds per instance), while the "
        "difference-multiplicity route used at most 234 modular operations "
        "once the affine symmetry was seen."
